ates.","Keep walking through the garden to the gate.","Keep walking through the garden to the gates.","Keep walking through the garden until you reach the gate.","Keep walking through the garden until you reach the gates.","Walk through the garden to the gate.","Walk through the garden to the gates.","Walk through the garden until you reach the gate.","Walk through the garden until you reach the gates."]},{"id":"4","prompt":"Идите вдоль реки, но не переходите мост.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Go along the river but do not cross the bridge.","Go along the river but do not walk across the bridge.","Go along the river but do not go across the bridge.","Walk along the river but do not cross the bridge.","Walk along the river but do not walk across the bridge.","Walk along the river but do not go across the bridge."]},{"id":"5","prompt":"Направляйтесь к станции, но поверните налево, не доходя до неё.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Head towards the station but turn left before you reach it.","Head towards the station but turn left before reaching it.","Head towards the station but turn left before it.","Head toward the station but turn left before you reach it.","Head toward the station but turn left before reaching it.","Head toward the station but turn left before it.","Go towards the station but turn left before you reach it.","Go towards the station but turn left before reaching it.","Go towards the station but turn left before it.","Go toward the station but turn left before you reach it.","Go toward the station but turn left before reaching it.","Go toward the station but turn left before it.","Walk towards the station but turn left before you reach it.","Walk towards the station but turn left before reaching it.","Walk towards the station but turn left before it.","Walk toward the station but turn left before you reach it.","Walk toward the station but turn left before reaching it.","Walk toward the station but turn left b